Algorithm :

1. Start the program.
2. Accept the existing users and friendship pairs.
3. Create the graph using an adjacency list.
4. Enter the name of the new user.
5. Check whether the user already exists.
6. If the user exists, display an appropriate message.
7. Otherwise, add the new user and create an empty adjacency list.
8. Enter the name of an existing user to establish friendship.
9. Check whether the existing user is valid.
10. If valid, add the friendship in both directions.
11. Display the updated adjacency list.
12. Stop the program.
